      "uncited_sentences": [
        "They use a sequence labeling scheme where the input is the raw sentence and the output for each token is a single label.",
        "For constituency parsing, three partial and separate labels are generated through task-dependent feed-forward networks on top of the stacked biLSTMs.",
        "For dependency parsing, the first task consists in predicting the head of a word, and the second task predicts the type of the relation.",
        "The loss is computed as the sum of the main task loss and an auxiliary loss for the other parsing paradigm."
